cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Replication package for "Reassessing Code Authorship Attribution in the Era
  of Language Models"
message: >-
  If you use this software or the accompanying datasets, please cite both the
  paper and this repository.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SageSELab/code-authorship"

# TODO before submission: expand the given names for A. K. Dipongkor and Z. Yao
